-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Removed before release
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Earlier, unpublished revisions of this repository vendored four further Frida
scripts (log_ssl_keys.js, no_root.js, log_aes_info.js, log_ad_ids.js) and
attributed all of them to the PiRogue Tool Suite under AGPL-3.0. That attribution
was wrong: log_ssl_keys.js originates from MIT-licensed work by other authors,
no_root.js from the fridantiroot project with no licence grant accompanying the
copy, and the provenance of log_aes_info.js was never established. Rather than
restate the attribution, those files were removed — friTap covers their function —
so nothing here is redistributed without a clear licence basis. This is recorded
deliberately: the error was caught before publication, and anyone auditing the
project should be able to see how it was resolved.

